rick","id":146759331,"node_id":"U_kgDOCL9eow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146759331?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick","html_url":"https://github.com/lodetrick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-16T23:27:08Z","updated_at":"2025-05-16T23:27:08Z","body":"I still think the icon_name has a use because it is a lot more flexible (it can be used in light or dark mode), maybe it could be `icon` -> `override_icon` and `icon_name` -> `default_icon`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2887838172/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2887892475","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106503#issuecomment-2887892475","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106503","id":2887892475,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sIb37","user":{"login":"KeyboardDanni","id":34800072,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODAwMDcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34800072?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni","html_url":"https://github.com/KeyboardDanni","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-17T00:34:28Z","updated_at":"2025-05-17T00:34:28Z","body":"I mentioned this already in the Godot Contributors Chat, but I'm concerned about every dock being added to the menubar under \"Editor Docks\". The problem is that this shows every possible context-sensitive dock to the user, even when they wouldn't normally be visible. For example, the \"Tilemap\" dock usually only appears when you are editing a Tilemap. I'm not exactly sure under what circumstances you'd want to access that dock when you're not editing a Tilemap. As goofy as the Microsoft Office Ribbon is, I feel that this is one aspect they did get right at least. In versions of Microsoft Office before 2007 the UI was crammed with a lot of toolbars, docks, selectable windows, that sort of thing, for features that aren't even active so they're just taking up space.\r\n\r\nI could see the need to be able to access a dock that isn't context-relevant if you want to adjust where it is in the layout, but I'm not sure how best to approach that. Some programs temporarily show any stuff that would normally be hidden when you go into the \"layout edit mode\" but Godot doesn't really have that.\r\n\r\nI do like the idea of being able to move docks that would normally be bottom-locked, and put them in other parts of the UI. But also a lot of bottom docks are situational, and them being at the bottom communicates that. So moving them elsewhere doesn't really fit the established paradigm.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2887892475/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2887937239","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106503#issuecomment-2887937239","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106503","id":2887937239,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sImzX","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-17T01:30:04Z","updated_at":"2025-05-17T01:30:04Z","body":"That's unrelated to this PR though. It only changes internals, the editor so far works the same as before.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2887937239/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2890097211","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106503#issuecomment-2890097211","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106503","id":2890097211,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sQ2I7","user":{"login":"lodetrick","id":146759331,"node_id":"U_kgDOCL9eow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146759331?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick","html_url":"https://github.com/lodetrick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-19T08:25:25Z","updated_at":"2025-05-31T16:50:49Z","body":"It seems that changing the order of operations allowed plugins that don't set icons to show a broken icon:\r\n<img width=\"151\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7f9bb078-5fae-485b-9aae-ef9e85e2270a\" />\r\nSeen below, an empty icon_name would load the broken file icon, when we want the window icon.\r\n`p_dock->dock_icon.is_valid() ? p_dock->dock_icon : tab_container->get_editor_theme_icon(p_dock->icon_name);`\r\nUnfortunately to keep the new order of operations, I can't see a method that would reduce/keep the complexity of code.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2890097211/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"resolved"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2891907897","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106503#issuecomment-2891907897","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106503","id":2891907897,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sXwM5","user":{"login":"lodetrick","id":146759331,"node_id":"U_kgDOCL9eow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146759331?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick","html_url":"https://github.com/lodetrick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-19T18:17:23Z","updated_at":"2025-05-31T16:23:54Z","body":"We should probably also clip the contents of the docks:\r\n<img width=\"641\" alt=\"Not Clipped\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ffa4eaa9-5c59-4f94-bd2d-80fdd6abec12\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2891907897/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"resolved"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2925460396","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106503#issuecomment-2925460396","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106503","id":2925460396,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uXvus","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-31T17:16:27Z","updated_at":"2025-05-31T17:16:27Z","body":"Updated. From more important changes:\r\n- I added `default_slot` property, which replaces the slot argument of `add_dock()`\r\n- I added `layout_key` property, which is a string representing this dock in the layout file\r\n- Changed `_set_horizontal_layout()` to `_update_layout()`, the argument is now the new layout\r\n  - This will be useful if we decide to add more layouts (maybe Floating or something)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengi